      "The commission established the immediate cause without serious dispute. A rubber seal in a joint of a solid rocket booster failed to close the joint at the unusually low temperature on the morning of the launch.",
      "On that point there is no conflict between the texts. The physical finding was agreed by everyone, demonstrated in a public hearing with a piece of the material and a glass of iced water, and it has never been contested.",
